From: UMP <ump@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 70/90] Remember Shapes.joinIsNotEmpty answers by shape
 identity

Block registration asks joinIsNotEmpty for every state's faces and support types (BlockStateBase.Cache), with the same immutable shape objects shared by many states: with 184 mods (826,000 states) it was most of the mods' start. Its answers are kept by the identity of the two shapes and the operation (bounded, 2M entries; HORIZON_SHAPE_MEMO=0 turns it off). Same answers, same order, same threads: nothing a mod sees changes.

UMP, 184 mods warm: remembered 11.07M of 11.93M calls; main entrypoints 26-28 s -> 20-22 s; ready 88-97 -> 84-88 s, join 43-48 s.
